Let DSA switch drivers supply the wire path for QinQ multicast.

The consumer submits a bridge and its complete receiver set. The driver
publishes the conduit and VLAN tags only after verifying the hardware rule.
QCA8337 uses the same receiver resolution for programming and lookup.

